{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Before it was in the earth.</b> The reason is that at their creation they existed in potentiality and not in actuality, such that <b>every plant of the field</b> was not yet in the earth, and likewise <b>every herb of the field</b> had not yet sprouted." "<b>For it had not rained.</b> Inasmuch as the matter was not prepared for this in perfection, due to the lack of rain and the cultivation of the earth."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:37.434596133Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}